   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dce3253d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# MULTIMAMBA — Multimodal Hb Estimation (Eye Image + Weight / Height / SES)\n",
    "\n",
    "Extends every image-only Mamba / CNN / ViT model from `run_ensemble.ipynb` into a\n",
    "**multimodal** model that fuses the eye image with tabular clinical variables\n",
    "(**Height, Weight, Socio-economic status = APL/BPL**).\n",
    "\n",
    "**How it works.** A single generic `MultiModalWrapper` wraps *any* existing model\n",
    "(all of them end in `.cls_head` / `.reg_head`). A forward-pre-hook grabs the pooled\n",
    "image feature going into `cls_head`, fuses it with an encoding of the tabular\n",
    "variables, and feeds the result to fresh dual heads. Nothing in the original model\n",
    "files is modified.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Fusion modes compared** (literature shows plain concat under-mixes modalities —\n",
    "FiLM / gating / attention fuse better): `concat`, `film`, `gate`, `attn`.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Structure**\n",
    "1. Config — *edit only the first cell* (K for CV, task, columns, tabular toggles, fusion).\n",
    "2. Data + tabular preprocessing (per-fold standardisation → no leakage).\n",
    "3. Fusion wrapper + task-specific losses/metrics.\n",
    "4. K-fold runner (K=1 → single holdout; K≥2 → StratifiedKFold, test mean±std).\n",
    "5. **Main pass** — all models with the default fusion.\n",
    "6. **Ablations (end of file)** — fusion-mode sweep, per-variable contribution\n",
    "   (image-only → +Height → +Weight → +SES), and a tabular-only reference.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "4706f623",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ==============================================================\n",
    "#            ALL VARIABLES -- EDIT ONLY THIS BLOCK\n",
    "# ==============================================================\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Cross-validation --------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "K = 1                       # 1..5 : K=1 -> single holdout, K>=2 -> StratifiedKFold\n",
    "assert 1 <= K <= 5, \"K must be between 1 and 5\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Task --------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "TASK = \"regression\"     # \"classification\" (anemic < HB_THRESH) | \"regression\" (exact Hb)\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Dataset paths -----------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "IMAGE_DIR   = \"/media/junaid/DATA/JUNAID/ANEMIA/dataset/left_eye\"\n",
    "CSV_PATH    = \"/media/junaid/DATA/JUNAID/ANEMIA/dataset/merge_excel_1.xlsx\"\n",
    "IMAGE_DIR_2 = \"\"            # optional 2nd dataset slot (e.g. right_eye)\n",
    "CSV_PATH_2  = \"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Column names (must match the Excel headers EXACTLY) ---------------------\n",
    "IMAGE_COL  = \"Patient ID\"\n",
    "HB_COL     = \"Haemoglobin (gm/dL)\"\n",
    "HB_THRESH  = 12.0\n",
    "HEIGHT_COL = \"Height\"\n",
    "WEIGHT_COL = \"Weight\"\n",
    "SES_COL    = \"Socio-economic status\"\n",
    "SES_MAP    = {\"APL\": 0.0, \"BPL\": 1.0}     # APL/BPL -> numeric (unknown -> 0.0)\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Multimodal / tabular ----------------------------------------------------\n",
    "USE_TABULAR      = True                    # master switch: add tabular vars to the model\n",
    "USE_SES          = True                    # include socio-economic status feature\n",
    "NUMERIC_FEATURES = [HEIGHT_COL, WEIGHT_COL]# standardised numeric tabular features\n",
    "FUSION           = \"film\"                  # MAIN-pass fusion: \"concat\"|\"film\"|\"gate\"|\"attn\"\n",
    "FUSION_MODES     = [\"concat\", \"film\", \"gate\", \"attn\"]   # compared in the ablation\n",
    "TAB_HIDDEN       = 64                       # tabular MLP width\n",
    "FUSE_DIM         = 128                      # token dim for \"attn\" fusion\n",
    "TAB_DROPOUT      = 0.2\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- HB range filter / augmentation -----------------------------------------\n",
    "HB_FILTER_MIN = 7.0\n",
    "HB_FILTER_MAX = 15.0\n",
    "USE_AUGMENTATION = True\n",
    "AUG_BINS         = 10\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Training ----------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "EPOCHS      = 3\n",
    "BATCH_SIZE  = 32\n",
    "LR          = 1e-4\n",
    "VAL_SPLIT   = 0.2          # used when K == 1\n",
    "TEST_SPLIT  = 0.1          # fixed held-out test set (locked across all folds)\n",
    "NUM_WORKERS = 4\n",
    "SEED        = 42\n",
    "EARLY_STOP  = 8\n",
    "SCHEDULER   = \"cosine\"     # \"cosine\" | \"plateau\" | None\n",
    "GRAD_ACCUM  = 1\n",
    "WARMUP_EPOCHS = 3\n",
    "USE_AMP     = True\n",
    "FREEZE_BACKBONE = True     # EfficientMamba / timm baselines\n",
    "IMG_SIZE    = 224\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Preprocessing -----------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "PREPROCESS = {\"colorspace\": \"RGB\", \"use_clahe\": False,\n",
    "              \"clahe_clip\": 2.0, \"clahe_grid\": (8, 8)}\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Classification-specific settings ---------------------------------------\n",
    "CLS_CONFIG = {\"use_focal_loss\": True, \"focal_gamma\": 2.0,\n",
    "              \"use_class_weights\": True, \"threshold\": 0.5}\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Regression-specific settings -------------------------------------------\n",
    "REG_CONFIG = {\"normalize_hb\": True, \"hb_min\": 4.0, \"hb_max\": 20.0,\n",
    "              \"loss_fn\": \"huber\", \"huber_delta\": 1.0}\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Novel-model architecture cfg -------------------------------------------\n",
    "NEW_MODEL_CFG = {\"embed_dim\": 128, \"depth\": 4, \"d_state\": 64,\n",
    "                 \"colour_proj\": \"learned\", \"n_experts\": 5}\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Which models to run in the MAIN pass -----------------------------------\n",
    "RUN = {\n",
    "    # Mamba variants\n",
    "    \"Mamba1\": True, \"Mamba2\": True, \"Mamba3\": True, \"VMamba\": True,\n",
    "    \"MambaVision\": True, \"MedMamba\": True, \"VSSD\": True, \"DSA_Mamba\": True,\n",
    "    \"EfficientMamba\": True, \"AdaptiveScan\": True, \"MoEMamba\": True, \"CrossFusion\": True,\n",
    "    # CNN / ViT baselines\n",
    "    \"ResNet50\": True, \"EfficientNetB3\": True, \"DenseNet121\": True,\n",
    "    \"MobileNetV3\": True, \"ViT_B16\": True,\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Ablation config (runs at the END of the notebook) ----------------------\n",
    "ABLATION_MODEL        = \"Mamba2\"   # backbone used for the ablations (any key in RUN)\n",
    "RUN_ABLATION_FUSION   = True       # compare every mode in FUSION_MODES\n",
    "RUN_ABLATION_VARIABLE = True       # image-only -> +Height -> +Weight -> +SES\n",
    "RUN_ABLATION_TABONLY  = True       # tabular-only MLP reference (no image)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Each step = (label, numeric_feature_list, use_ses).  Shows each variable's marginal gain.\n",
    "ABLATION_STEPS = [\n",
    "    (\"image-only\",           [],                       False),\n",
    "    (\"+Height\",              [HEIGHT_COL],             False),\n",
    "    (\"+Height+Weight\",       [HEIGHT_COL, WEIGHT_COL], False),\n",
    "    (\"+Height+Weight+SES\",   [HEIGHT_COL, WEIGHT_COL], True ),\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- Repo path autodetect ----------------------------------------------------\n",
    "import os, sys\n",
    "def _find_repo_root():\n",
    "    cands = [os.getcwd(), os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"ALLMAMBA\")]\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        for d in os.listdir(os.getcwd()):\n",
    "            p = os.path.join(os.getcwd(), d)\n",
    "            if os.path.isdir(p): cands.append(p)\n",
    "    except Exception: pass\n",
    "    cands.append(\"/home/junaid/Desktop/MULTIMAMBA\")\n",
    "    for c in cands:\n",
    "        if os.path.isdir(os.path.join(c, \"MAMBA_MODELS\")): return c\n",
    "    return os.getcwd()\n",
    "\n",
    "REPO_ROOT  = _find_repo_root()\n",
    "MODELS_DIR = os.path.join(REPO_ROOT, \"MAMBA_MODELS\")\n",
    "if MODELS_DIR not in sys.path: sys.path.insert(0, MODELS_DIR)\n",
    "\n",
    "CV_DESC = \"single holdout\" if K == 1 else f\"{K}-fold StratifiedKFold\"\n",
    "print(f\"TASK        : {TASK}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Cross-val   : K={K}  ({CV_DESC})\")\n",
    "print(f\"Multimodal  : USE_TABULAR={USE_TABULAR}  USE_SES={USE_SES}  fusion={FUSION}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Numeric feat: {NUMERIC_FEATURES}\")\n",
    "print(f\"MODELS_DIR  : {MODELS_DIR}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Models ON   : {[k for k,v in RUN.items() if v]}\")\n"
   ]
  },
