    "# ─────────────────────────  ABLATIONS  ─────────────────────────\n",
    "\n",
    "Everything below is diagnostic and runs on a single backbone (`ABLATION_MODEL`) so the\n",
    "comparisons are apples-to-apples. Three studies:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Fusion sweep** — which of `concat / film / gate / attn` fuses the tabular data best.\n",
    "2. **Per-variable contribution** — image-only → +Height → +Weight → +SES, so you can\n",
    "   see exactly how much each new variable helps.\n",
    "3. **Tabular-only reference** — how much signal is in the clinical variables alone."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ca80c4db",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Ablation 1 — Fusion-mode sweep"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "2843fa72",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "FUSION_ABL = []\n",
    "if RUN_ABLATION_FUSION:\n",
    "    if ABLATION_MODEL not in IMG_BUILDERS:\n",
    "        print(f\"ABLATION_MODEL '{ABLATION_MODEL}' has no builder; skipping fusion sweep.\")\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        base = IMG_BUILDERS[ABLATION_MODEL]\n",
    "        feats = NUMERIC_FEATURES if USE_TABULAR else []\n",
    "        for mode in FUSION_MODES:\n",
    "            try:\n",
    "                factory = make_factory(base, True, mode)\n",
    "                run_model_kfold_mm(f\"{ABLATION_MODEL}\", factory, feats, USE_SES,\n",
    "                                   results_list=FUSION_ABL, tag=f\"fusion={mode}\")\n",
    "            except Exception as e:\n",
    "                _fail(f\"{ABLATION_MODEL}[{mode}]\", e, results_list=FUSION_ABL)\n",
    "    FUSION_DF = results_frame(FUSION_ABL)\n",
    "    if FUSION_DF is not None:\n",
    "        FUSION_DF[\"fusion\"] = [r[\"tag\"].split(\"=\")[-1] for r in FUSION_ABL if r.get(\"status\")==\"PASS\"]\n",
    "        print(FUSION_DF.to_string(index=False))\n",
    "        FUSION_DF.to_csv(\"multimamba_ablation_fusion.csv\", index=False)\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"RUN_ABLATION_FUSION=False -> skipped.\")"
   ]
  },
